              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabilund wacu ang’o’ Ya Thekdhanumange, m’ulubo bedopwe ngo, utundo kum bedopwe, cil bedopwe ma en e mi yioyic: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.30",
